{"title":"Career roadmap · Sports Manager","role":"Sports Manager","summary":"Career alignment: A Sports Manager manages the business, operations, marketing, finance, events, partnerships, athletes, facilities or commercial activities of a sports organisation. The career can span professional teams, leagues, federations, academies, sports facilities, sports-tech companies, event companies, athlete management and sports marketing.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A BBA Sports Management graduate should combine sports-industry knowledge + business management + analytics + marketing + event operations + commercial skills."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Typical Role","Primary Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"Entry"},{"text":"Sports Management Executive / Sports Operations Executive"},{"text":"Day-to-day sports operations"}],[{"text":"1–3 years"},{"text":"Sports Coordinator / Sports Business Executive"},{"text":"Events, teams, facilities or partnerships"}],[{"text":"2–5 years"},{"text":"Sports Manager / Sports Operations Manager"},{"text":"Operations and business management"}],[{"text":"4–7 years"},{"text":"Senior Sports Manager / Commercial Manager"},{"text":"Revenue, sponsorship and strategic operations"}],[{"text":"6–10 years"},{"text":"Head of Sports Operations / Sports Business Head"},{"text":"Organisation-wide management"}],[{"text":"10+ years"},{"text":"Director of Sports / Sports Business Director"},{"text":"Strategy and leadership"}],[{"text":"Entrepreneurial"},{"text":"Sports Entrepreneur / Sports Academy Founder"},{"text":"Sports business ownership"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build During BBA Sports Management","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Business + Sports Industry Foundations"},{"type":"h","text":"Business fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Pri